  63:     tools?: MCPServerTool[];
  65:     resources?: MCPResource[];
  67:     prompts?: MCPPrompt[];
  69:     stdio?: boolean;
  73:     port?: number | null;
  75:     logging?: boolean;
```

`handleRequest()` dispatches sensitive MCP methods directly:

```text
src/praisonai-ts/src/mcp/server.ts
